#: includes/settings/content/developers.php:992
msgid ""
"Admin and Frontend are the full URL of the sprite used by "
"tcres_svg_icon_get() when the call does not pass file. Empty uses the plugin "
"sprite, assets/images/icons.svg. The admin URL is used in the admin. The "
"frontend URL is used on the public site."
msgstr ""
"Administració i Frontend són l'URL completa de l'sprite que fa servir "
"tcres_svg_icon_get() quan la crida no passa file. Si és buit, s'usa l'sprite "
"del plugin, assets/images/icons.svg. L'URL d'administració s'usa a "
"l'escriptori. L'URL de frontend s'usa al lloc públic."

#: includes/settings/navigation.php:35
msgid "Administration"
msgstr "Administració"

#: includes/settings/content/developers.php:828
msgid ""
"After each response, an option with no matches gets is-unavailable on its "
"checkbox label and on the Choices.js item (.choices__item[data-value]). The "
"script does not disable or hide it. The whole filter gets is-unavailable "
"when every real option is unavailable. Each filter is tested without its own "
"current values. Only the first 50 options are checked; any option after "
"those is marked unavailable. If a selected value is no longer available, "
"that filter is cleared and the listing runs once more. Start Choices.js in "
"the theme; the script reads the native control."
msgstr ""
"Després de cada resposta, una opció sense coincidències rep is-unavailable a "
"l’etiqueta del checkbox i a l’ítem de Choices.js (.choices__item[data-value])"
". L’script no la desactiva ni l’amaga. El filtre sencer rep is-unavailable "
"quan totes les opcions reals no estan disponibles. Cada filtre es prova "
"sense els seus valors actuals. Només es comproven les 50 primeres opcions; "
"qualsevol de posterior es marca com a no disponible. Si un valor seleccionat "
"deixa d’estar disponible, aquell filtre es neteja i el llistat es torna a "
"executar una vegada. Engegueu Choices.js al tema; l’script llegeix el "
"control natiu."

#: includes/settings/content/login.php:128
msgid ""
"After logout (admin or frontend), always redirect to a configured "
"destination."
msgstr ""
"Després de tancar la sessió (administració o frontend), redirigeix sempre a "
"una destinació configurada."

#: includes/api/output-location.php:16
msgid "After post content"
msgstr "Després del contingut de l’entrada"

#: includes/settings/content/developers.php:695
msgid ""
"AJAX post listing. Register the query in PHP. The theme writes the grid, the "
"toolbar, and the navigation, and chooses which controls exist. "
"tcres_query_listing_attrs() prints the signed attributes on the theme grid, "
"and tcres_query_listing_items() prints the cards inside it. The pieces share "
"data-tcres-query-listing-id and do not need a common parent, so the toolbar "
"can live in an offcanvas. Several toolbars with the same id stay in sync. "
"The plugin calls tcresQueryListingInit() on DOMContentLoaded; call it again "
"after injecting a listing dynamically."
msgstr ""
"Llistat d’entrades per AJAX. Registreu la consulta en PHP. El tema escriu la "
"graella, la barra d’eines i la navegació, i tria quins controls existeixen. "
"tcres_query_listing_attrs() imprimeix els atributs signats a la graella del "
"tema, i tcres_query_listing_items() imprimeix les targetes a dins. Les peces "
"comparteixen data-tcres-query-listing-id i no necessiten un pare comú, així "
"que la barra pot viure en un offcanvas. Diverses barres amb el mateix id es "
"mantenen sincronitzades. El connector crida tcresQueryListingInit() a "
"DOMContentLoaded; crideu-lo de nou després d’injectar un llistat de forma "
"dinàmica."

