#: includes/settings/content/developers.php:734
msgid ""
"Locked query. relation is AND (default) or OR, and it only combines these "
"clauses with each other. A filter is type taxonomy (values are taxonomy "
"slugs; in and and mean the post has a term in that taxonomy, not_in means it "
"has none) or type term (taxonomy, operator in, and, or not_in, values are "
"term slugs). The visitor cannot remove it. Visitor filters are added with "
"AND, so a toolbar OR cannot leave it. Omit it for no locked terms. The first "
"page and the base total use this query, before any toolbar control."
msgstr ""
"Consulta fixa. relation és AND (per defecte) o OR, i només combina aquestes "
"clàusules entre si. Un filtre és de tipus taxonomy (els values són slugs de "
"taxonomia; in i and volen dir que l’entrada té un terme d’aquesta taxonomia, "
"not_in que no en té cap) o de tipus term (taxonomy, operador in, and o "
"not_in, els values són slugs de terme). El visitant no el pot treure. Els "
"seus filtres s’afegeixen amb AND, així que un OR de la barra no en pot "
"sortir. Ometeu-lo si no hi ha termes fixos. La primera pàgina i el total "
"base usen aquesta consulta, abans de qualsevol control de la barra."

